      "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>A method based on a logical explanation of the mechanism of heat transfer associated with the boiling process is presented for correlating heat-transfer data for nucleate boiling of liquids for the case of pool boiling. The suggested relation is clTxhfg=Csf(q/A\u03bclhfg(q/A)\u03c3g(\u03c1l-\u03c1v))0.33(cl\u03bclkl)1.7 where the various fluid properties are evaluated at the saturation temperature corresponding to the local pressure and Csf is a function of the particular heating surface-fluid combination.</jats:p>",
